<title>UK: Electronics Boutique sees profit for year.</title>
<headline>Electronics Boutique sees profit for year.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>British retailer Electronics Boutique Plc said on Thursday it expected to post a small profit for its fiscal year ending this month compared to a loss of 8.5 million stg last year.</p>
</text>
